  "label": "Author's Note",
  "title": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "shortTitle": "Authors Note",
  "file": "chapters/05-authors-note.json",
  "index": 5,
  "sourceRange": [
    80,
    97
  ],
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book is not written to explain life.   "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 81
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is written to document what happens when thoughts stay longer than emotions, and "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 82
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "silence slowly replaces reaction.   "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 83
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There are no fixed meanings hidden between these pages.   "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 84
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No advice.   "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 85
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "No conclusions.   "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 86
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Only observations.   "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 87
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Only inner shifts that were too subtle to notice in real time.   "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 88
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is not a story of healing.   "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 89
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is a story of states.   "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 90
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Of phases where you stop recognizing your own patterns, but "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 91
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "still continue living inside them.   "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 92
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If you find yourself somewhere in these pages, it "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 93
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "is not because the book is about you.   "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 94
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is because these states are more common than we admit… just rarely "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 95
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "spoken in words."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 96
    }
  ],
